{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24980","headline":"翁母些 · 牟融","name":"翁母些","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"满头华发向人垂，长逝音容逈莫追。\n先壠每怀风木夜，画堂无复彩衣时。\n停车遥望孤云影，翘首惊看吊鹤悲。\n独有贤人崇孝义，伤心共咏蓼莪诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牟融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24980.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24980","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}